### Index a GitHub repository
POST http://localhost:8000/indexing/index
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "github_url": "https://github.com/huggingface/transformers"
}

### Index financial documents
POST http://localhost:8000/indexing/index/financial
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "local_path": "/Users/ericmelz/Data/code/RAG-Code-clone-course-wip/backend/data/sample_financial_data",
  "description": "AcmeWackoWidgets 2025 financial reports"
}

### List all indexed GitHub repos
GET http://localhost:8000/indexing/repos

### List all indexed sources (GitHub + financial)
GET http://localhost:8000/indexing/sources

### Chat - simple greeting (GitHub namespace)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "message": "How are you?",
  "namespace": "huggingface-transformers"
}

### Chat - codebase question (GitHub namespace)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "message": "What does this codebase do?",
  "namespace": "huggingface-transformers"
}

### Chat - financial question 1 - no contradiction
POST http://localhost:8000/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "message": "What was the Total Revenue for WackWidget1000 in FY 2025?",
  "namespace": "users-ericmelz-data-code-rag-code-clone-course-wip-backend-data-sample-financial-data"
}

